[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0010","text":"来来来，请坐请坐！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0020","text":"诶，什，什么──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0030","text":"嘿嘿，先保密！\n不过灯织的话，肯定马上就能猜到吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0040","text":"什么意思……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0050","text":"呵呵，提示是香味……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0060","text":"诶……？\n……啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0070","text":"嗯，闻起来好香……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0080","text":"回答正确！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0090","text":"跟真乃一起，给你做了礼物！\n刚出炉的哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_20300100_03_0100","text":"总是让你给我们做吃的，\n今天轮到我们了！"}]
